WEBVTT

00:35.660 --> 00:37.495
There he is! Get the guns ready!

00:47.464 --> 00:48.465
Kill him!

01:08.359 --> 01:10.153
Die, asshole!

01:17.410 --> 01:18.453
Damn it!

01:41.851 --> 01:43.645
Shit! Where is he?

01:43.728 --> 01:44.979
Where'd he go?

01:45.063 --> 01:46.606
Show yourself!

01:46.689 --> 01:47.690
You son of a bitch!

01:47.774 --> 01:50.610
<i>There once was a legendary hit man.</i>

01:51.486 --> 01:53.113
<i>His name was...</i>

01:56.783 --> 01:59.410
<i>Taro Sakamoto.</i>

02:02.872 --> 02:07.418
<i>He was feared by every gangster,</i>

02:07.502 --> 02:11.381
<i>admired by every hit man.</i>

02:12.382 --> 02:14.300
<i>Until, one day...</i>

02:16.761 --> 02:18.513
Hi! May I help you?

02:21.850 --> 02:23.935
<i>He fell in love.</i>

02:25.061 --> 02:26.312
<i>He retired,</i>

02:27.397 --> 02:28.439
<i>got married,</i>

02:29.357 --> 02:30.692
<i>had a child,</i>

02:31.192 --> 02:32.068
<i>and...</i>

02:34.737 --> 02:37.949
<i>Sakamoto got fat.</i>

04:12.252 --> 04:15.088
THE LEGENDARY HIT MAN

04:15.171 --> 04:17.173
SAKAMOTO'S

04:17.257 --> 04:18.841
This has to be it.

04:19.676 --> 04:20.969
I looked all over for you,

04:21.469 --> 04:22.762
Mr. Sakamoto.

04:24.681 --> 04:25.974
SAKAMOTO

04:26.057 --> 04:27.892
Hey Mister, watch this!

04:28.476 --> 04:32.272
If I can hit this target,
you have to give me a free juice box!

04:32.355 --> 04:34.565
Oh my, what are you doing?

04:34.649 --> 04:37.402
He's been coming a lot recently, huh?

04:37.485 --> 04:38.361
Yep.

04:43.116 --> 04:45.368
Oh, darn it!

04:45.451 --> 04:46.286
One more try!

04:46.369 --> 04:49.080
Mister, watch me get it this time!

04:49.831 --> 04:50.665
Oops!

04:50.748 --> 04:52.667
CALLIGRAPHY INK

04:56.796 --> 04:58.506
Uh-oh.

04:59.173 --> 05:01.467
What the hell! You little brat!

05:01.551 --> 05:02.844
Look at my white pants!

05:02.927 --> 05:05.596
- Oh, no! Honey, what should we do?
- How dare you!

05:05.680 --> 05:07.724
Let me go!

05:15.189 --> 05:16.399
You're dead!

05:27.535 --> 05:29.370
Creepy fat-ass!

05:30.079 --> 05:33.708
Thank you, Mister...

05:33.791 --> 05:35.793
There, there, don't cry.

05:35.877 --> 05:37.712
There, there!

05:37.795 --> 05:38.713
Brilliant move.

05:40.298 --> 05:43.384
A pen into the lower jaw,
straight through the carotid artery.

05:44.343 --> 05:46.179
I could see it.

05:47.638 --> 05:50.099
It's been too long, Mr. Sakamoto.

05:51.017 --> 05:52.477
It's me, Shin the Psychic.

05:53.394 --> 05:54.687
HIT MAN / PSYCHIC
SHIN

06:00.068 --> 06:02.820
Stop killing people in your mind!

06:02.904 --> 06:04.280
It's me, Shin!

06:04.363 --> 06:06.449
I used to work under you!

06:09.035 --> 06:11.120
So it was true, huh?

06:11.204 --> 06:12.371
You went straight

06:12.455 --> 06:14.957
- and started a mom-and-pop shop.
- Come on, let's go!

06:15.041 --> 06:16.876
SAKAMOTO'S

06:16.959 --> 06:19.378
Please come back, Mr. Sakamoto.

06:19.462 --> 06:20.630
You're too good.

06:20.713 --> 06:22.924
I mean, look at you now. That body!

06:23.883 --> 06:25.551
<i>My days as a hit man are over.</i>

06:29.555 --> 06:33.559
<i>You used to be feared by every gangster.</i>

06:33.643 --> 06:35.937
<i>They called you "the legendary hit man."</i>

06:36.813 --> 06:39.440
Why would you throw that all away?

06:46.739 --> 06:47.615
<i>Delicious!</i>

06:48.199 --> 06:50.576
You used to only eat field rations.

06:51.202 --> 06:54.038
Honestly, I can barely recognize you now.

07:04.924 --> 07:07.093
<i>That... that speed!</i>

07:07.176 --> 07:09.679
<i>"Fat or not, I can kill you any day."</i>

07:09.762 --> 07:11.264
<i>Is that what he's telling me?</i>

07:12.932 --> 07:15.268
Hi there, Mr. Sakamoto!

07:15.351 --> 07:17.437
Sorry to tear you away from your meal,

07:17.520 --> 07:19.230
but I've got a favor to ask.

07:19.313 --> 07:21.357
<i>A favor from Mr. Sakamoto?</i>

07:22.358 --> 07:25.611
<i>Is he disguising as a civilian
to ask for a hit?</i>

07:27.572 --> 07:31.159
This tree's gotten so tall,
I can't cut those branches.

07:31.659 --> 07:33.494
Can you get 'em, Mr. Sakamoto?

07:34.829 --> 07:38.166
Oh, looks great! You're amazing!

07:38.875 --> 07:42.086
Mr. Sakamoto,
my daughter won't eat her veggies.

07:45.798 --> 07:46.966
Yummy!

07:47.800 --> 07:50.344
We only have one ball to play with!

07:55.183 --> 07:56.684
Thank you!

07:58.561 --> 08:00.646
Are you the handyman for the whole town?!

08:03.816 --> 08:04.942
I get it now.

08:05.026 --> 08:08.821
You've done a good job
hiding your true identity.

08:08.905 --> 08:11.073
But I gotta say, Mr. Sakamoto,

08:11.991 --> 08:13.826
from where I'm standing,

08:14.911 --> 08:17.079
you just look ridiculous.

08:17.747 --> 08:18.748
I'll be back.

08:21.292 --> 08:22.835
You brat!

08:27.840 --> 08:30.510
<i>It's been five years since I last saw him.</i>

08:31.177 --> 08:33.221
<i>He's let himself go in more ways than one.</i>

08:34.555 --> 08:35.473
<i>But...</i>

08:36.098 --> 08:39.602
<i>Damn, Mr. Sakamoto is awesome!</i>

08:39.685 --> 08:43.022
Even with the extra weight,
he's still got that aura!

08:43.105 --> 08:47.527
If only! We could work! Together! Again!

08:47.610 --> 08:48.694
Don't look!

08:50.488 --> 08:52.782
BOSS

08:54.033 --> 08:55.076
Hello?

08:55.159 --> 08:56.536
<i>Did you convince him?</i>

08:57.036 --> 08:57.912
Well, no, but--

08:57.995 --> 09:00.790
<i>So, you killed him, then?</i>

09:03.292 --> 09:04.293
Boss.

09:04.919 --> 09:07.713
Come on, do we have to?

09:07.797 --> 09:11.592
Mr. Sakamoto's really fat now.
I don't think he'd cause any issues if--

09:11.676 --> 09:12.885
Shin.

09:13.803 --> 09:18.140
If someone disappears from the gang,
we make 'em disappear from the earth.

09:18.808 --> 09:20.977
That's the rule and Sakamoto broke it.

09:21.477 --> 09:23.479
We can't let him go.

09:24.146 --> 09:25.898
You know, Shin,

09:26.524 --> 09:29.902
if you can't get it done,
I can always send someone else!

09:29.986 --> 09:32.572
Stop complaining
or you'll be joining him in--

09:33.614 --> 09:35.533
Oh, shut up.

09:38.244 --> 09:40.621
Guess I have no choice...

09:57.805 --> 09:59.056
TWO DAYS' WORTH OF VITAMINS

10:18.743 --> 10:21.537
<i>If I don't do it, someone else will.</i>

10:25.249 --> 10:26.959
<i>So if he's gonna die either way...</i>

10:32.131 --> 10:34.842
<i>I... should be the one to do it.</i>

10:36.594 --> 10:40.056
Hey, what kind of poop
do you think this is?

10:40.139 --> 10:42.808
Ew! That's gross!

10:44.310 --> 10:46.520
Oh! You're the boy from yesterday.

10:46.604 --> 10:47.980
Shin, right?

10:48.064 --> 10:49.857
You're back already?

10:51.275 --> 10:54.862
Look what I found!
I think it's alien poop!

10:55.696 --> 10:57.490
Sorry, kiddos.

10:59.825 --> 11:01.744
It's time for war.

11:16.050 --> 11:19.011
ROBBERY SUSPECTS STILL AT LARGE!

11:23.474 --> 11:25.351
Hi again, Mr. Sakamoto.

11:26.268 --> 11:30.106
I'm probably going to leave town today,

11:30.731 --> 11:32.983
so I thought I'd come by to say...

11:38.531 --> 11:39.532
goodbye!

11:51.168 --> 11:52.336
<i>A cough drop?</i>

12:01.512 --> 12:03.597
<i>Damn it, I can't read his mind.</i>

12:08.644 --> 12:09.687
<i>Where is he?</i>

12:10.563 --> 12:11.981
SOOTHING COUGH DROPS

12:27.746 --> 12:28.831
CUSTARD CREAM PUFF

12:28.914 --> 12:31.375
<i>Damn it! I gotta fix my stance and--</i>

12:40.384 --> 12:41.302
<i>Damn...</i>

12:48.184 --> 12:51.395
<i>What was I thinking...</i>

13:00.404 --> 13:03.324
Dinner's almost ready!
Help me set the table.

13:03.407 --> 13:04.450
Okay!

13:06.452 --> 13:08.496
Hey, he's awake!

13:08.579 --> 13:09.872
Oh!

13:09.955 --> 13:11.415
Thank goodness.

13:14.502 --> 13:15.711
Where am I?

13:16.337 --> 13:18.047
The second floor above the shop.

13:20.466 --> 13:22.718
Why don't you join us for dinner?

13:22.801 --> 13:23.636
Huh?

13:23.719 --> 13:25.971
- Um...
- Do you want extra rice?

13:26.055 --> 13:28.390
Extra extra? Mega extra?

13:29.642 --> 13:30.935
A normal amount, please.

13:32.061 --> 13:33.812
- Let's eat!
- Let's eat!

13:33.896 --> 13:36.732
<i>How did this happen?</i>

13:36.815 --> 13:38.108
<i>I tried to kill him...</i>

13:39.902 --> 13:41.362
<i>Wait, maybe this is poisoned!</i>

13:42.988 --> 13:45.199
<i>I've trained to withstand poison.
I'll be fine.</i>

13:51.997 --> 13:53.040
So good...

13:54.291 --> 13:55.793
So warm!

13:57.044 --> 13:59.421
He's reacting just like you did back then.

13:59.505 --> 14:01.298
Same as Daddy!

14:02.383 --> 14:03.342
<i>What is it?</i>

14:03.926 --> 14:05.302
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

14:05.886 --> 14:08.889
<i>I've never felt this way in
any of the jobs I've done.</i>

14:10.474 --> 14:11.559
<i>I get it now.</i>

14:12.977 --> 14:14.770
<i>Mr. Sakamoto...</i>

14:14.853 --> 14:18.399
<i>wants to protect these little moments
of everyday life.</i>

14:19.858 --> 14:21.026
<i>That's why he quit...</i>

14:25.239 --> 14:29.660
SAKAMOTO'S

14:30.703 --> 14:32.037
Mr. Sakamoto,

14:32.121 --> 14:33.122
I...

14:37.710 --> 14:39.086
Thank you for dinner.

14:43.257 --> 14:45.885
THANK YOU! PLEASE COME AGAIN.
- SAKAMOTO'S

14:50.306 --> 14:52.683
<i>I'm still no match</i>

14:52.766 --> 14:54.351
<i>for Mr. Sakamoto.</i>

15:04.653 --> 15:07.072
What is it, Shin?

15:10.492 --> 15:12.119
What an embarrassment.

15:12.202 --> 15:15.372
You couldn't kill him, could you?

15:16.707 --> 15:17.791
Boss...

15:17.875 --> 15:18.918
What?

15:19.001 --> 15:20.836
Don't give me any excuses.

15:20.920 --> 15:23.797
Please let Mr. Sakamoto live!

15:24.924 --> 15:27.635
- How pathetic!
- What's wrong with you, Shin?

15:28.636 --> 15:30.095
Why?

15:30.179 --> 15:32.181
Why are you defending Sakamoto?

15:32.264 --> 15:36.101
He has people to go home to now.

15:36.185 --> 15:39.521
Sakamoto broke the rules of our world.

15:39.605 --> 15:41.857
He abandoned his responsibilities.

15:41.941 --> 15:43.359
So, we must kill him.

15:44.151 --> 15:45.653
Then hold me responsible.

15:45.736 --> 15:47.321
I'll die instead.

15:48.113 --> 15:50.240
So please, let Mr. Sakamoto go.

15:51.075 --> 15:52.868
Why are you doing this for him?

15:54.244 --> 15:56.789
I pointed my gun at someone I admired.

15:57.706 --> 15:59.249
This is my way of owning up.

16:01.543 --> 16:03.003
Fine.

16:03.087 --> 16:06.256
You die and I'll let Sakamoto live.

16:08.008 --> 16:09.259
<i>Dumbass.</i>

16:09.343 --> 16:11.470
<i>As if I'd ever let that happen.</i>

16:11.553 --> 16:13.180
<i>Just die, you idiot.</i>

16:14.098 --> 16:15.432
I heard that.

16:17.017 --> 16:19.186
I knew I couldn't expect much from you.

16:19.269 --> 16:20.813
<i>Did he read my mind?</i>

16:21.689 --> 16:22.690
Kill him!

16:22.773 --> 16:23.983
<i>Bring it on.</i>

16:24.775 --> 16:27.027
SAKAMOTO'S

17:11.822 --> 17:13.532
<i>I'll blow his brains out!</i>

17:28.213 --> 17:30.257
<i>I can see everything from up here.</i>

17:34.053 --> 17:35.054
Damn it!

17:35.137 --> 17:37.431
What are you doing? It's just one guy!

17:37.514 --> 17:40.726
It's like he knows what we're about to do.

17:40.809 --> 17:42.978
He's a psychic!

17:43.062 --> 17:45.230
If you get too close,
he'll read your mind.

17:45.314 --> 17:47.107
Keep your distance, surround him!

17:58.660 --> 18:00.287
<i>This is my last mag.</i>

18:01.955 --> 18:03.624
<i>I gotta force my way out somehow.</i>

18:09.129 --> 18:10.005
<i>Damn it!</i>

18:20.057 --> 18:21.183
<i>I guess this is it...</i>

18:33.529 --> 18:35.030
Mr. Sakamoto...

18:35.114 --> 18:37.074
Sakamoto?

18:37.157 --> 18:38.033
Kill him!

18:39.034 --> 18:40.119
Die!

18:47.459 --> 18:48.460
Son of a--

18:55.259 --> 18:56.677
Go to hell!

19:07.396 --> 19:08.272
Shit!

19:12.526 --> 19:13.986
Screw you!

19:16.363 --> 19:18.991
WASTE

19:27.040 --> 19:29.418
<i>What... just happened?</i>

19:29.501 --> 19:31.003
You're dead!

19:35.257 --> 19:36.842
Don't try to take him on alone.

19:36.925 --> 19:38.260
We'll shoot together.

19:42.431 --> 19:43.557
Now!

19:53.775 --> 19:55.569
You... piece of shit!

19:57.821 --> 19:59.239
<i>This is insane.</i>

19:59.323 --> 20:00.199
<i>It's him.</i>

20:01.909 --> 20:03.619
<i>The legendary hit man,</i>

20:04.453 --> 20:05.871
<i>Taro Sakamoto!</i>

20:09.249 --> 20:11.627
Mr. Sakamoto, how'd you know I was here?

20:17.716 --> 20:19.885
What? A bug?

20:20.636 --> 20:23.055
<i>Did you plant this last night?</i>

20:23.138 --> 20:25.140
<i>Nothing gets past you, does it?</i>

20:26.391 --> 20:27.768
Mr. Sakamoto,

20:27.851 --> 20:29.394
I actually meant what I said.

20:29.978 --> 20:31.813
No matter the outcome,

20:32.356 --> 20:35.317
I was gonna leave town toda--

20:36.526 --> 20:37.402
SHIN

20:37.486 --> 20:38.946
An apron?

20:39.529 --> 20:41.240
Eight hundred yen an hour.

20:41.782 --> 20:43.700
For overtime...

20:45.661 --> 20:46.578
I'll pay extra.

20:46.662 --> 20:47.663
<i>What?</i>

20:55.879 --> 20:57.547
SAKAMOTO'S

20:57.631 --> 20:58.799
Mr. Sakamoto,

20:59.424 --> 21:02.135
could you not eat ramen right next to me?

21:03.804 --> 21:05.639
This is a brand-new shirt.

21:06.390 --> 21:09.059
Plus, we're running out of ramen...

21:09.142 --> 21:10.978
We're home!

21:11.061 --> 21:12.437
Oh, my!

21:12.521 --> 21:14.690
Shin, the apron looks great on you.

21:14.773 --> 21:16.024
Oh, does it?

21:16.108 --> 21:17.776
Lookin' dapper!

21:22.447 --> 21:24.199
Here you go, ma'am.

21:24.283 --> 21:27.119
Oh, how'd you know?

21:27.202 --> 21:29.204
This is just what I was looking for!

21:29.288 --> 21:30.539
Thank you, sweetie.

21:30.622 --> 21:32.541
He really is psychic!

21:32.624 --> 21:34.960
Hey! Come play with me!

21:35.043 --> 21:36.253
After my shift's over.

21:36.920 --> 21:37.838
Come on!

21:37.921 --> 21:40.132
Is that even fun?

21:40.215 --> 21:42.968
Well, I don't really know yet,

21:43.719 --> 21:46.388
but it beats my last job for sure.

21:46.471 --> 21:48.557
What'd you do at your last job?

21:48.640 --> 21:50.017
<i>Tell him and I'll kill you.</i>

21:51.476 --> 21:54.438
Well, you could say I was a cleaner!

21:54.521 --> 21:55.522
In a sense.

22:02.487 --> 22:03.947
Hurry up!

22:05.240 --> 22:06.700
Welcome in!

23:32.452 --> 23:37.457
Subtitle translation by: Yuka Kristi
